<section><div class="wrap"><h2>What xBot does</h2><p class="sub">Everything members use day to day in the server.</p><div class="cards"><div class="card"><h3>Economy</h3><p>Earn, save and spend a server currency with work, bank, shop and more.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Levels and roles</h3><p>Chat to level up and unlock roles as you go.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Confessions</h3><p>Share anonymously, with logs kept for moderators.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Tickets</h3><p>Get help from staff with a single command.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Boosts</h3><p>Thank server boosters and follow the boost leaderboard.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>SquishMallows</h3><p>Collect them in drops and special events.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section id="commands"><div class="wrap"><h2>Commands</h2><p class="sub">Use <code>xhelp [command]</code> in Discord for details. Some commands show usernames in lists.</p><div class="row"><h3>AFK</h3><p>afk</p></div><div class="row"><h3>Administrator</h3><p>addbalance, announce, levelrole, levelroles, removebalance, separator, setlevel, shoprole</p></div><div class="row"><h3>Boost</h3><p>boost, boost channel, boosttest, boosting, boostlb</p></div><div class="row"><h3>Confessions</h3><p>confess, confessions, confessions channel, confessions logs</p></div><div class="row"><h3>Economy</h3><p>balance, bank, buy, deposit, give, messages, shop, steal, withdraw, work</p></div><div class="row"><h3>Fun</h3><p>ball, facts, ship</p></div><div class="row"><h3>Miscellaneous</h3><p>help, ping, snipe</p></div><div class="row"><h3>Nicknames</h3><p>nickname, nicknames, nicknames channel</p></div><div class="row"><h3>Profile</h3><p>level</p></div><div class="row"><h3>SquishMallows</h3><p>drop, squishmallowschannel, squishmallowsevent, squishmallows</p></div><div class="row"><h3>Suggestions</h3><p>suggest, suggestions</p></div><div class="row"><h3>Tickets</h3><p>ticket</p></div><div class="row"><h3>Welcomes</h3><p>welcomes</p></div></div></section>
